      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A practical guide for Intermediate students and families planning B.Tech engineering admissions in Andhra Pradesh or Telangana. Explains MPC percentage calculation, post-matric fee reimbursements (JnanaBhumi and ePASS), institutional merit scholarships, and four-year fee planning.</rdf:li>
